Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.63,0:02:05.10,Default,N,0,0,0,,So, the invasion of Mino will ride on what happens at Sunomata.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.10,0:02:07.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,Pretty clever.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.63,0:02:09.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,We need to make this work.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.78,0:02:13.22,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu won't just sit\Nback and let it happen.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.19,Default,N,0,0,0,,Then you convince him, Viper.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.19,0:02:16.74,Default,D,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.74,0:02:18.86,Default,D,0,0,0,,It's eat or be eaten.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.03,0:02:22.08,Default,N,0,0,0,,Like father, like son.{I'm probably way off. TLC plz. -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:22.39,0:02:25.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,Then we'll just have to build\Na fort however we can.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.00,0:02:28.16,Default,D,0,0,0,,You'll build nothing more \Nthan a pile of bodies.{Line was fine as it was('end up with nothing more'), but I wanted to play off the previous line :D -GBF}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.85,0:02:31.44,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Making a fort in Sunomata is impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.07,0:02:42.72,Default,N,0,0,0,,Hanbei, what do {\i1}you{\i0} think?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.71,0:02:50.52,Default,H,0,0,0,,I-I think that whoever controls \NSunomata controls Mino.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.07,0:02:55.23,Default,H,0,0,0,,Only by doing the impossible c-can\Nyou prove yourself worthy to rule.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.29,0:03:02.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,So, the genius strategist \N{\i1}is{\i0} pretty smart.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,You're thinking just what I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:04.80,0:03:08.00,Default,H,0,0,0,,Drop the monkey and serve me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.34,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.34,0:03:10.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobuna...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.63,0:03:16.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.38,0:03:20.05,Default,H,0,0,0,,I've sworn to serve Mr. Yoshiharu!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hanbei...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.63,0:03:27.01,Default,N,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.35,0:03:33.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,Monkey will help me, \Nand you help him.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.87,0:03:37.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,Do everything you can \Nto help me conquer.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.60,0:03:40.11,Default,H,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.37,0:03:42.20,Default,N,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.74,0:03:45.73,Default,N,0,0,0,,our plans for building the fort...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.73,0:03:47.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's finally time for this event?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.95,0:03:50.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've seen this event dozens of times \Nin {\i0}Legends of the Civil Wars!{\i1}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,889)\i1}The overnight construction of\Nthe fort at Sunomata!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.50,Default,N,0,0,0,,...will be entrusted to Shibata Katsuie.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.93,0:03:56.00,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,Do you have a problem with that?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,I sure do!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.48,0:04:00.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,Obviously it should be me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.28,0:04:03.89,Default,N,0,0,0,,I don't want anybody to think I'm \Ngiving you special treatment.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.33,0:04:06.98,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,After Okehazama and convincing Hanbei to defect,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.98,0:04:10.14,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,some people might be unhappy\Nthat you're getting all the glory.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.41,0:04:12.68,Default,N,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.68,0:04:14.19,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Katsuie.{SPLIT PLZ}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.63,0:04:16.31,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.{*Boing*}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.01,0:04:18.65,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Why are you all so scared?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.17,0:04:21.78,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Do you think you can \Nbeat Nobuna like that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.25,0:04:24.30,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Hanbei's defection has \Nbecome well known.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.30,0:04:26.26,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,The soldiers' morale is low.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.91,0:04:29.64,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,A genius strategist and \NOda's powerful armies...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.64,0:04:32.66,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,In an even match, she'll \Nburn Mino to the ground.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.50,Default,Y,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.50,0:04:39.25,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,It might be worth working with \Nher like Count Dousan did.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.76,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Never let me hear you say that again!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.26,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.26,0:04:46.52,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Dousan chose Nobuna, not me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.52,0:04:48.58,Default,Y,0,0,0,,I'll never forget that humiliation.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.19,0:04:50.26,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Reporting!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.26,0:04:53.10,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Oda is attempting to construct \Na fortification in Sunomata!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.10,0:04:54.54,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,In Sunomata?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.31,0:04:57.92,Default,Y,0,0,0,,The fool is at our mercy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.92,0:05:00.02,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Take your men and destroy her.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.02,0:05:01.40,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.40,0:05:03.86,Default,Y,0,0,0,,When we've slain Nobuna,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.86,0:05:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall make you the new Mino Three.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.54,0:05:14.06,Default,K,0,0,0,,Stay strong!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.06,0:05:15.28,Default,K,0,0,0,,Put out the fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.28,0:05:17.48,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Constructing a fort \Nlike this is impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.48,0:05:19.62,Default,K,0,0,0,,We need to do it no matter what!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.13,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,General Katsuie, we must retreat!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.03,0:05:26.84,Default,K,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.51,0:05:31.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,So not only Shibata, but Niwa and \NSakuma have failed as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sunomata must be a vision of hell itself.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.60,0:05:37.35,Default,Na,0,0,0,,In all likelihood, Monkey will try next.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.35,0:05:38.30,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.85,0:05:42.36,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,The man who took Hanbei from you?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.65,Default,Na,0,0,0,,He'll possibly...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.65,0:05:47.52,Default,Na,0,0,0,,No. He'll definitely do \Nsomething unexpected.{SPLIT PLZ}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.52,0:05:50.37,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You seem impressed by him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.37,0:05:53.82,Default,Na,0,0,0,,But... in the end,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.82,0:05:58.17,Default,Na,0,0,0,,the one to take Mino and Nobuna, will be none other than me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.94,0:06:01.42,Default,S,0,0,0,,You can't just keep sending \Npeople out there to get killed!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.42,0:06:03.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,The standard methods won't work!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.76,0:06:06.49,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me do it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.49,0:06:08.66,Default,N,0,0,0,,Because you always do something crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.66,0:06:10.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,Are you... worried about me?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.96,0:06:13.97,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's natural for a lord to be \Nworried about her retainers!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.97,0:06:17.01,Default,N,0,0,0,,I-I'm not worried about \Nyou specifically.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.01,0:06:19.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please let me do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.13,0:06:21.69,Default,N,0,0,0,,You have a plan, don't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.69,0:06:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.64,0:06:23.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,Build it in just one night!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:24.15,0:06:25.15,Default,N,0,0,0,,In one night?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.71,0:06:29.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,If it goes up in a single night, \Nthey won't be able to stop it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.28,0:06:36.18,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's strange. When you say it, \Nit actually sounds possible.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.87,0:06:39.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.13,0:06:43.24,Default,N,0,0,0,,If you're leading an operation of this size, you're a real general.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.24,0:06:46.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,You'll need a symbol on your \Nflag for your monkey armies.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.81,0:06:48.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,A gourd?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.17,0:06:53.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Toyotomi Hideyoshi conquered Japan \Nunder the sign of the gourd.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.68,0:06:55.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, it {\i0}is{\i1} the same...{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}No. I won't let that happen!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.99,0:07:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll make sure the one who\N conquers Japan is {\i0}Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.25,0:07:02.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll take it gladly.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.39,0:07:04.81,Default,N,0,0,0,,This is an order.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.81,0:07:07.07,Default,N,0,0,0,,Come back alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.53,0:07:08.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.08,Default,N,0,0,0,,Move out!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.43,0:07:27.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,So, we have from dusk till dawn.{:Doriginally 'until tomorrow morning.'}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.80,0:07:30.80,Default,N,0,0,0,,Yeah. We {\i1}will{\i0} make this work.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.77,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Nobuna's on the march?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.77,0:07:42.77,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yes. She's taken almost her \Nentire army toward Kisogawa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.77,0:07:46.04,Default,Y,0,0,0,,So, she's given up on Sunomata?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.85,0:07:51.52,Default,Y,0,0,0,,I'll give you 2,000 men.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.52,0:07:53.60,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Bring me Nobuna's head.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.25,0:07:55.78,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Without you, sir?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.78,0:07:57.36,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.36,0:07:59.20,Default,Y,0,0,0,,It's all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.73,0:08:06.24,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu's forces have \Nleft Inabayama Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.46,Default,N,0,0,0,,Looks like we drew them out.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.09,Default,N,0,0,0,,This way, we'll keep them well away from Sunomata.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.09,0:08:14.18,Default,K,0,0,0,,But still... using you as a decoy...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's all part of the plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.15,0:08:22.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,Once we've cut down enough trees,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.72,0:08:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll start assembling them \Ninto parts for the fort.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.20,0:08:28.52,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,This is beyond belief.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.42,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's a construction technique \Nfrom the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,You make the parts for a \Nbuilding somewhere else,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.94,0:08:38.10,Default,N,0,0,0,,carry them to the area, and \Nbuild the structure quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.78,0:08:41.48,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,You're way too proud of that.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.32,Default,H,0,0,0,,A splendid strategy.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.32,0:08:46.96,Default,H,0,0,0,,The question is whether \NMiss Nobuna can make it back
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.96,0:08:49.42,Default,H,0,0,0,,before our defensive forces are spent.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.39,0:08:53.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,We don't need to worry about Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.20,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.59,0:09:01.64,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.06,0:09:04.48,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,something's strange about the \Nmovement of Yoshitatsu's forces.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.31,Default,N,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.07,0:09:09.48,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,They've headed for a narrow \Nspace between two mountains.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.48,0:09:11.38,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,I believe they're trying to lure us in.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.69,0:09:16.57,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,An abandoned gold mine?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.57,0:09:19.20,Default,K,0,0,0,,They must be planning \Nto use it as a stronghold.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.57,0:09:22.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's fine that we're drawing \Nthem away from Sunomata,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.00,0:09:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but if we take too long getting \Nback, Monkey and his men...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.07,0:09:27.96,Default,K,0,0,0,,Why don't we just destroy them here?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.96,0:09:31.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,Our goal here is the construction \Nof a fort at Sunomata.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.00,0:09:32.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,In that case, shall we send the army back?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.76,0:09:37.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,0)\i1}You lead them away from me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.22,0:09:39.60,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll build the fort while you do!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.09,0:09:44.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,We'll continue with the decoy plan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.07,0:09:47.36,Default,Y,0,0,0,,We're ready to welcome them, yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.36,0:09:48.98,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.98,0:09:51.88,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,None of them will survive.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.90,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,But what of Inaba and the others?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.81,0:09:59.15,Default,Y,0,0,0,,They will be sacrificed to kill \NNobuna and ensure Mino's safety.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.15,0:10:00.70,Default,Y,0,0,0,,I'm sure they won't mind.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.61,0:10:12.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,All rafts, head for Sunomata!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.65,0:10:27.41,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu's forces have set up camp \Non the other side of this town.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.41,0:10:29.02,Default,N,0,0,0,,Let's be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.02,0:10:32.28,Default,N,0,0,0,,If we're surrounded here, it's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.03,0:10:36.40,Default,K,0,0,0,,Enemy attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.49,0:10:38.84,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Follow the plan!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.16,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.16,0:10:43.86,Default,Y,0,0,0,,{\i1}You will be decoys, drawing Nobuna in.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.86,0:10:47.91,Default,Y,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will attack from behind \Nwith our main force.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.27,0:10:51.08,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,A splendid plan, one worthy \Nof the Viper's son!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.08,0:10:53.83,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,If only he was more of a man!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.83,0:10:57.76,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,If we can defeat Oda here,\Nperhaps that means he really is!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.52,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,Why do {\i1}I{\i0} have to help?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.52,0:11:14.15,Default,H,0,0,0,,Shut up and work.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.15,0:11:16.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,Make sure it doesn't fall apart.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.25,0:11:20.00,Default,H,0,0,0,,No one at Inabayama Castle has noticed us yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.00,0:11:20.91,Default,S,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.29,0:11:26.16,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let it stay that way... please!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.07,0:11:33.51,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to go too deep.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.51,0:11:35.38,Default,K,0,0,0,,But they're persistent.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:35.75,0:11:37.18,Default,N,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.18,0:11:39.76,Default,N,0,0,0,,We have to be at Sunomata by dawn.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.23,0:11:41.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,They're taking too long!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.34,0:11:44.64,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,When is Lord Yoshitatsu \Ngoing to get here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.64,0:11:47.38,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,All we're doing is losing men!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.89,0:11:49.02,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.53,0:11:50.56,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.56,0:11:53.54,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,We can't find Yoshitatsu in their camp!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.54,0:11:54.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.78,0:11:59.44,Default,K,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, it's only Inaba and\NUjiie's men who are fighting here.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.44,0:12:01.00,Default,N,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.99,Default,N,0,0,0,,Oh, no! It's a trap!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.48,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.48,0:12:18.00,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.55,0:12:26.76,Default,K,0,0,0,,The whole area's been laced with oil.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.76,0:12:29.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,Yoshitatsu tricked us.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.71,0:12:33.66,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Lord Yoshitatsu is planning on \Nkilling us here with Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.66,0:12:34.65,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,We've been tricked!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.02,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.95,0:12:42.90,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,The flames have surrounded us.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.17,0:12:45.78,Default,K,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.85,0:12:53.72,Default,N,0,0,0,,At this rate, Monkey will...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.71,0:13:00.05,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,Nobuna's trapped by the fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.71,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,At last...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.71,0:13:03.76,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,At last, I have won!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.76,0:13:08.44,Default,Yoshitatsu,0,0,0,,I'll have Owari, Mikawa, \Nand Oumi for my own!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.11,0:13:10.32,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,M-My lord!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.22,0:13:13.41,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Disaster!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.41,0:13:15.12,Default,Y,0,0,0,,What's all this ruckus?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.38,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,A-A fort...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.38,0:13:18.03,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,A fort in Sunomata!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.03,0:13:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.11,0:13:24.43,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,R-Ridiculous...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.43,0:13:25.42,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,It can't be...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.42,0:13:27.20,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,A fort built overnight?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.49,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.05,0:13:30.42,Default,Y,0,0,0,,March!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.42,0:13:32.49,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Destroy that fort!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.57,0:13:49.72,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.72,0:13:51.10,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,They're coming!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.51,0:13:52.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hanbei...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.76,0:13:53.94,Default,H,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.94,0:13:55.68,Default,H,0,0,0,,Sun Tzu's Art of War tells us
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.68,0:13:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,we should strike when most of their forces have crossed the river.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.11,0:14:02.11,Default,H,0,0,0,,Riflemen, open fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.57,0:14:11.33,Default,H,0,0,0,,Bowmen, target the troops \Nstill in the river!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.25,0:14:14.64,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Curse you, Hanbei.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.91,0:14:22.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna's forces will arrive soon!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.04,0:14:23.80,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hold out until they do!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.29,0:14:29.30,Default,N,0,0,0,,Everyone, don't give up!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.55,0:14:32.47,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,The enemy!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.56,Default,K,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.25,0:14:35.06,Default,K,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.39,0:14:36.98,Default,N,0,0,0,,Nobody move.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.24,0:14:42.44,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,You must be Oda Nobuna.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.48,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,We are but fools abandoned by our lord.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.99,0:14:50.34,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Now all that is left is \Nto choose a place to die.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.34,0:14:53.26,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,If we can take you with us,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.26,0:14:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,we shall keep our pride as warriors.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.95,0:14:57.70,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.10,0:15:02.47,Default,N,0,0,0,,Of course it's better that you don't die.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.47,0:15:04.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,If you haven't tried as \Nhard as you can to live,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.84,0:15:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,how can you seek a place to die?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.46,0:15:08.97,Default,N,0,0,0,,Live, live, keep living 'til the end!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.32,0:15:13.33,Default,N,0,0,0,,You can think about where to \Ndie when you're in your coffin!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.33,0:15:14.47,Default,N,0,0,0,,Got it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:15.71,0:15:17.98,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,You're telling us to survive? \NIn this situation?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.67,0:15:20.23,Default,N,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.23,0:15:23.24,Default,N,0,0,0,,Everyone, get all the \Ngunpowder you can find.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.24,0:15:25.52,Default,N,0,0,0,,If this was a gold mine, there \Nshould still be some about.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.53,0:15:29.52,Default,Ak,0,0,0,,We're out of ammunition!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.52,0:15:31.91,Default,G,0,0,0,,The east side can't hold.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.91,0:15:34.02,Default,H,0,0,0,,At this rate, we'll be wiped out.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.02,0:15:36.91,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'll use my double to open \Nus a path to escape.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.66,0:15:39.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,We'll protect Sunomata.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.32,0:15:41.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,I promised Nobuna we would.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.63,0:15:42.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,I won't let us get wiped out.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.59,0:15:47.32,Default,H,0,0,0,,I love the way you don't \Nwant to abandon anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.32,0:15:48.30,Default,H,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.07,0:15:51.18,Default,G,0,0,0,,You're too greedy, Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.81,0:15:54.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,I... I won't give up.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.32,0:15:55.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna will come!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.31,0:15:57.39,Default,G,0,0,0,,Sagara!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.23,0:16:08.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,Go-Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.75,0:16:20.75,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.25,0:16:26.41,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,She blew away the fire with gunpowder.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.41,0:16:28.42,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Fighting fire with fire?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.42,0:16:32.32,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Who would think of something so insane?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.05,0:16:35.64,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,But it's exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.55,0:16:39.64,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Like the first time we met Count Dousan.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.64,0:16:46.19,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,436)}Yes. I think I understand why Andou and Hanbei joined her.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.84,0:16:49.40,Default,N,0,0,0,,Let us make it, please!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:58.58,0:17:00.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wake up, Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.51,0:17:01.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,Goemon!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.01,0:17:14.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,Is this really happening?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.49,0:17:20.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,Was I too childish?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.67,0:17:23.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,Tell me...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.31,0:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.61,0:17:33.07,Default,N,0,0,0,,Hurry! Go faster!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.40,0:17:40.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.91,0:17:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't happening.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.01,0:17:48.33,Default,N,0,0,0,,I couldn't have been too late.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.34,0:17:53.78,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.69,0:17:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:00.60,0:18:03.12,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.98,0:18:13.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're late, Nobuna!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.23,0:18:14.32,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.73,0:18:29.88,Default,N,0,0,0,,All forces,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.69,0:18:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,charge!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.88,0:18:35.67,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Nobuna should be dead!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.67,0:18:37.59,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,But it's definitely her!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.63,0:18:42.43,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,And Inaba and Ujiie have defected!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.43,0:18:45.48,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Our forces are routed!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.48,0:18:46.94,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Ludicrous.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.94,0:18:49.44,Default,Y,0,0,0,,This is ludicrous!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.31,0:18:56.40,Default,Na,0,0,0,,Now both armies are at my mercy.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.33,0:19:02.20,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,I won't let you pass.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.35,0:19:04.45,Default,Na,0,0,0,,Niwa?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.97,0:19:07.48,Default,Na,0,0,0,,The princess sent me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.48,0:19:10.69,Default,Na,0,0,0,,This battle is Sagara Yoshiharu's.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.69,0:19:13.28,Default,Na,0,0,0,,If any coward tries to interfere...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.83,0:19:18.98,Default,Na,0,0,0,,even if it's Asai Nagamasa,\Nshe's ordered me to kill them.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,We managed to win...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.26,0:19:26.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:28.27,0:19:30.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,G-Goemon?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.88,0:19:34.54,Default,G,0,0,0,,Every ninja wears chain mail.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.36,Default,G,0,0,0,,I got knocked out, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.33,0:19:39.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,Y-You idiot!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.23,0:19:42.10,Default,G,0,0,0,,It's good for greedy Yoshiharu
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.10,0:19:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to experience losing something for onc—
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.59,0:19:50.75,Default,G,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.75,0:19:52.87,Default,G,0,0,0,,You can't just g-g-grab me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.87,0:19:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do that... I'll just... It's too...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.77,0:20:02.30,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,Saitou Yoshitatsu was captured,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.30,0:20:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,and at last, Mino became the \Nterritory of the Oda clan.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.97,0:20:10.89,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,And Nobuna renamed \NInabayama Castle as Gifu Castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.81,0:20:15.81,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Kill me already.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.81,0:20:19.57,Default,Y,0,0,0,,As long as I'm alive, I'll fight you.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.57,0:20:21.95,Default,D,0,0,0,,That's right. Kill him.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.43,0:20:26.58,Default,N,0,0,0,,Stop being stubborn and enjoy \Nyour retirement together.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.58,0:20:28.08,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:28.73,0:20:30.36,Default,N,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.36,0:20:32.96,Default,N,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo, cut Yoshitatsu's ropes.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.58,Default,D,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.57,0:20:40.34,Default,Y,0,0,0,,You're taking pity on me?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.34,0:20:41.46,Default,D,0,0,0,,You mustn't!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.46,0:20:44.92,Default,D,0,0,0,,That naïveté will cost \Nyou your life someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.92,0:20:45.84,Default,N,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.84,0:20:47.48,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's my decision.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:48.19,0:20:50.68,Default,D,0,0,0,,You foolish girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.95,0:20:58.48,Default,Y,0,0,0,,My father was correct just now.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.48,0:21:01.28,Default,Y,0,0,0,,You really are a fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.09,0:21:04.36,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,You just spared his life. \NHow can he say that?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:04.36,0:21:05.62,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.62,0:21:10.08,Default,N,0,0,0,,Really, both of them are so stubborn.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:10.57,0:21:13.08,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Next, the matter of rewards...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,Just a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.52,0:21:15.84,Default,S,0,0,0,,Before we get to that...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.84,0:21:29.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're looking pretty gloomy.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.44,0:21:33.60,Default,D,0,0,0,,Because of me, she's left \Nherself an enemy.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.60,0:21:34.92,Default,D,0,0,0,,It bothers me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.43,0:21:40.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna didn't want you to carry \Nthe sin of killing your son.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.22,0:21:42.44,Default,D,0,0,0,,She's naïve! Far too naïve!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.44,0:21:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm an old fool who should already be dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.82,0:21:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dousan the Viper."
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.86,0:21:50.86,Default,D,0,0,0,,A few more evil deeds at this \Npoint mean nothing to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.83,0:21:56.82,Default,D,0,0,0,,I should've died at Nagara River.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.39,0:22:00.92,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm not worthy to be her father.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.92,0:22:02.93,Default,S,0,0,0,,You blind old man!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.93,0:22:04.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,Look out there.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.47,0:22:07.54,Default,S,0,0,0,,And say the new name of this castle.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.54,0:22:08.89,Default,D,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:11.77,0:22:13.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,Have a long life.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.44,0:22:17.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're the only father she has left.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.40,Default,D,0,0,0,,What's out there?
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.99,0:22:40.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}tada jidai no mannaka tatasarete tomadou toki ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:40.88,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}tada jidai no mannaka tatasarete tomadou toki ni
Dialogue: 2,0:22:30.99,0:22:40.88,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}When I, lost in time, was standing there confused
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.99,0:22:40.88,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}When I, lost in time, was standing there confused
Dialogue: 10,0:22:34.29,0:22:35.46,Default,D,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.43,0:22:40.04,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}From now on, this is Gifu Castle.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.04,0:22:42.25,Default,N,0,0,0,,{\i1}And the town of Gifu.{\i0}
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.59,0:22:51.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}te wo hiite kureta hito e dekiru koto sagashita
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.59,0:22:51.18,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}te wo hiite kureta hito e dekiru koto sagashita
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.59,0:22:51.18,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}You pulled me through, so I wanted to do something in return
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.59,0:22:51.18,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}You pulled me through, so I wanted to do something in return
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.26,0:22:49.16,Default,N,0,0,0,,Gifu Castle...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.13,0:22:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"Gifu," meaning stepfather...
Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.18,0:22:56.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}kizutsuki nagara warau sugata
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:56.39,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}kizutsuki nagara warau sugata
Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.18,0:22:56.39,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}You were smiling even though you were being hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:56.39,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}You were smiling even though you were being hurt
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.39,0:23:00.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}kokoro no ura namida ga mieta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:23:00.90,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}kokoro no ura namida ga mieta
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.39,0:23:00.90,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}I saw you shedding tears deep inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.39,0:23:00.90,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}I saw you shedding tears deep inside
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.90,0:23:06.40,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}sukui motomeru koe kikitoreru no wa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:06.40,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}sukui motomeru koe kikitoreru no wa
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.90,0:23:06.40,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}I could only understand your call for help
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.90,0:23:06.40,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}I could only understand your call for help
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.40,0:23:12.62,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}yurusareta mono dake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:12.62,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur4.5}yurusareta mono dake
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.40,0:23:12.62,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}When you opened up to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:12.62,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}When you opened up to me
Dialogue: 2,0:23:12.62,0:23:17.75,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}kazoe kirenu arashi wo koete
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:17.75,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}kazoe kirenu arashi wo koete
Dialogue: 2,0:23:12.62,0:23:17.75,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}I will overcome the countless storms
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:17.75,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}I will overcome the countless storms
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.75,0:23:23.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}anata no yami saku hikari ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:23.13,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}anata no yami saku hikari ni naru
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.75,0:23:23.13,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}And become the light that cuts through your darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:23.13,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}And become the light that cuts through your darkness
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.13,0:23:28.17,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}mou mayowanai tomo ni ikitai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:28.17,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}mou mayowanai tomo ni ikitai
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.13,0:23:28.17,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}I won't hesitate anymore; let's go together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:28.17,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}I won't hesitate anymore; let's go together
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.17,0:23:33.22,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}chikau yume ga donna mubou de atte mo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:33.22,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}chikau yume ga donna mubou de atte mo
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.17,0:23:33.22,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}No matter how unrealistic our ambitions are
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.17,0:23:33.22,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}No matter how unrealistic our ambitions are
Dialogue: 2,0:23:33.68,0:23:43.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}oboeteite shinjirareru basho wa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:43.65,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}oboeteite shinjirareru basho wa
Dialogue: 2,0:23:33.68,0:23:43.65,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}Remember there's a place you can believe in
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.68,0:23:43.65,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}Remember there's a place you can believe in
Dialogue: 2,0:23:43.65,0:23:47.82,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}koko ni aru to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:47.82,ED Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}koko ni aru to
Dialogue: 2,0:23:43.65,0:23:47.82,EDTL,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur1.5}Right here
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.65,0:23:47.82,EDTL - Border,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\\blur4.5}Right here
